---@field investmentDisbursedAt? string The start date on which the investment is disbursed to the investment accounts. This is not the same as the time of disbursement, but reflects the date you submitted with the attestation.
---@field attestedValue? aws.billing.Amount The monetary value attested.
---@field investmentDistributions? aws.billing.InvestmentDistributions The distribution of the attested investment across the eligible investment accounts. The list contains at most 200 distributions.
---@field rejectionReasons? aws.billing.RejectionReasons The reasons the attestation was rejected. This value is present only when attestationStatus is REJECTED. The list contains at most 30 reasons.
---@field isCancellable? boolean Indicates whether the attestation can be canceled with CancelContractualInvestmentAttestation.

